hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1386","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1387","Malik related to me from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman from his father from his father that Uthman ibn Affan gave him some money as qirad to use provided the profit was shared between them"
"1450","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab said while he was leaning his back against the Kaba"
"1451","Malik related to me that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1452","Malik related to me from Said ibn Amr Shurahbil ibn Said ibn Sad ibn Ubada from his father that his father said"
"1453","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"1454","Malik related to me that he heard that a man of the Ansar from the tribe of Banu al-Harith ibn al-Khazraj"
"1455","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1456","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm that Amr ibn Sulaym az-Zuraqi informed his father that it had been said to Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1457","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu Bakr ibn Hazm that a boy from Ghassan was dying in Madina while his heir was in Syria. That was mentioned to Umar ibn al-Khattab. It was said to him"
"1458","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Amir ibn Sad ibn Abi Waqqas that his father said"
"1459","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1460","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard al- Qasim ibn Muhammad say"
"1461","Yahya said that he heard Malik speak about a man who bought goods - animals or clothes or wares"
"1462","Malik related to me from Umar ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Dalaf al- Muzani from his father that a man from the Juhayna tribe used to buy camels before people set out for hajj and sell them at a higher price. Then he travelled quickly and used to arrive in Makka before the others who set out for hajj. He went bankrupt and his situation was put before Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1463","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1464","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1465","Malik said"